    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is a&nbsp;constant, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
